228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (The same scientific foundation can be applied to organizational challenges that appear fundamentally different. Because they all originate from the same source: the human brain.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
229 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (Across all of these domains, the same fundamental question is asked: What does this system's design produce in the human brain? The same scientific framework can then be applied to the following core organizational domains:)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
