232 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (If the same scientific framework can be applied across eight distinct organizational domains, then the underlying challenge was never domain-specific. This is the practical significance of the Behavioral Architecture perspective. Leadership development programs and AI adoption initiatives may appear fundamentally different on the surface, yet both depend on the same neurological conditions to produce sustainable outcomes. Understanding which conditions matter, the mechanisms through which they operate, and how they can be intentionally designed is the essence of the methodology. Those mechanisms become clearer as each domain is explored in depth.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
